  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d2d620a50a09a5d4baece4cddcab39fc, type: 3}
  m_Name: CartographerIntro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueData
  speakerName: The Old Cartographer
  lines:
  - Ah! A living traveler... the desert has not taken you yet.
  - I mapped these streets when the medina still breathed. Now I chart only what
    the ash leaves behind.
  - Old routes, hidden doors - all of it lives in my head, and my head is failing
    me.
  - Bring me what the ruins whisper, and I will draw you a path through SOLEDAR.
